<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-AUXERRE V DORTMUND TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUXERRE V DORTMUND TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>AUXERRE, France 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Wednesday's European Cup quarter-final second leg match between Auxerre of France and Dortmund of Germany:</p>
<p>Auxerre: 1-Lionel Charbonnier, 2-Alain Goma, 4-Franck Silvestre (cap), 13-Frederic Danjou, 12-Taribo West, 6-Philippe Violeau, 7-Sabri Lamouchi, 8-Moussa Saib, 10-Antoine Sibierski, 9-Lilian Laslandes, 11-Bernard Diomede.</p>
<p>Dortmund: 1-Stefan Klos, 17-Joerg Heinrich, 15-Juergen Kohler, 6-Matthias Sammer (cap), 16-Martin Kree, 18-Lars Ricken, 14-Paul Lambert, 19-Paulo Sousa, 10-Andreas Moeller, 13-Karlheinz Riedle, 9-Stephane Chapuisat.</p>
</text>
